  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Met en marche l'ascenseur du Repaire Rocket de Céladopole.",
      "short_effect": "Met en marche l'ascenseur du Repaire Rocket de Céladopole.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Operates the elevator in the Celadon Rocket Hideout.",
      "short_effect": "Operates the elevator in Team Rocket’s Celadon Hideout.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "An elevator key\nused in TEAM\nROCKET’s HIDEOUT.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A key that operates the elevator\nin TEAM ROCKET’s HIDEOUT.\nIt bears the TEAM ROCKET logo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ロケットだん　アジトに　ある\nエレベータを　うごかす　カギ。\nロケットだんの　マークいり。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로켓단아지트에 있는\n엘리베이터를 작동시키는 열쇠.\n로켓단의 마크가 새겨져 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能啟動火箭隊基地\n電梯的鑰匙。\n上面有火箭隊的標誌。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une clé activant l’ascenseur du Repaire de la Team\nRocket. Elle porte la marque de l’organisation.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Schlüssel, mit dessen Hilfe der Aufzug im\nRocket-Versteck in Gang gesetzt werden kann.\nDas Logo von Team Rocket ist darauf abgebildet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Llave que permite acceder al ascensor de la Guarida\ndel Team Rocket. Lleva grabado el símbolo del\nTeam Rocket.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chiave per l’ascensore nel Rifugio del Team Rocket.\nPresenta il logo del Team Rocket.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A key that operates the elevator in the Team Rocket\nHideout. It bears the Team Rocket logo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ロケット団　アジトに　ある\nエレベータを　動かす　カギ。\nロケット団の　マーク入り。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带有火箭队标志的钥匙。\n能启动位于火箭队基地的电梯。",
